  "document": "Wong Fei Hung Series\nThe Wong Fei Hung Series is a 1996 Hong Kong television film series of five stories about the Chinese folk hero Wong Fei-hung. The series was produced by Tsui Hark and starred Vincent Zhao, Maggie Shiu, Max Mok, Lau Shun, Kent Cheng, Hung Yan-yan, Power Chan and Cheung Chun-hung in the leading roles. It may be regarded as a television series counterpart to the \"Once Upon a Time in China\" film series, which were also produced by Tsui Hark and starred Vincent Zhao in two of the films."
